{"id":"d60c56f59d86adad","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-glsb-logic.md","title":"The Bimodal Truth Logic GLSB","display":"df-glsb-logic — The Bimodal Truth Logic GLSB","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-glsb-logic","aliases":["89-df-glsb-logic"],"display":"df-glsb-logic — The Bimodal Truth Logic GLSB","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-glsb-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-glsb-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-glsb-logic — The Bimodal Truth Logic GLSB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>，两个反射模式遍历双模态公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glsb\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLSB}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLB}\\cup\\{\\Box_iA\\to A\\mid i\\in\\{0,1\\},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glsb\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLSB}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLB}\\cup\\{\\Box_iA\\to A\\mid i\\in\\{0,1\\},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 205–207；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n唯一推理规则 MP，两个盒都不允许自由必然化。标准 PA 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证句为真，故两个反射模式保真。原书还给出其算术真值完全性及可判定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glsb\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLSB}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\n\\mathrm{GLB}\\cup\\{\\Box_iA\\to A\\mid i\\in\\{0,1\\},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1072,"backlinks":[{"id":"bb08f01f5311762f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c55a65d7df5b6430","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-glsb-logic]]、[[89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]] → [[89-df-omega-provability]] → [[89-df-bimodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glb-logic]] → [[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]] → [[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]] → [[89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete]] → [[89-df-glsb-logic]] → [[89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["5a9efa2261b8f73c"]}